        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "methods.first_sentence",
        "text": "本文围绕视觉Transformer的数据高效训练方法展开研究，梳理了参数高效适配、知识蒸馏等代表性方法的机制与贡献。"
      }
    },
    {
      "section_key": "abstract",
      "block_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "unit": {
        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "experiments.first_sentence",
        "text": "实验结果显示，Hint-Aug方法在Pet数据集上使用50%更少训练数据时可提升2.22%的准确率，KAdaptation方法在精度与参数效率的权衡中表现最优。"
      }
    },
    {
      "section_key": "abstract",
      "block_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "unit": {
        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "open_problems.first_sentence",
        "text": "现有针对Transformer的核心集选择方法在特定场景下的鲁棒性仍需验证，数据受限场景下结合先验知识提升数据效率仍是开放问题。"
      }
    },
    {
      "section_key": "conclusion",
      "block_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "unit": {
        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "introduction.first_sentence",
        "text": "视觉Transformer的数据高效训练方法可缓解其对数据量和计算资源的高需求，推动其在资源受限场景下的应用。"
      }
    },
    {
      "section_key": "conclusion",
      "block_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "unit": {
        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "methods.first_sentence",
        "text": "KAdaptation、数据自由知识蒸馏等方法在不同场景下展现出良好的数据效率，为视觉Transformer的部署提供了可行路径。"
      }
    },
    {
      "section_key": "conclusion",
      "block_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "unit": {
        "kind": "scientific",
        "body_sentence_id": "experiments.first_sentence",
        "text": "Hint-Aug等数据增强方法可在有限数据下提升视觉Transformer的性能，DeiT等数据高效变体在合理数据集上表现优异。"
      }
    },
    {
